Karyo WMS
Copyright 2026 Yashraj Padhi

Karyo WMS achieves behavioral parity with the myWMS warehouse management
system (GPL-3.0-or-later, Copyright LinogistiX GmbH / Matthias Krane) as an
independent implementation. No myWMS source code is included in, linked by,
or distributed with this software.

Optional commercial engines - Event monitors, Demand forecasting, Slotting
advisor, Reorder simulation, Cross-docking, Wave fulfillment, Order streaming,
Document templates, and Cartonization - are not included in this public
repository. Karyo source in this repository is licensed under Apache-2.0 as
stated in LICENSE; third-party materials remain under the licenses listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. See PAID-MODULES.md for engine descriptions, licence
keys, UI availability, and the route to the project captain.
